181
00:06:48,414 --> 00:06:50,313
- [Joel] Writers, oh brother.

182
00:06:50,313 --> 00:06:51,730
Tell me about it.

183
00:06:54,740 --> 00:06:56,894
- [Tom] There's Jessie "The Body" Vogel.

184
00:06:56,894 --> 00:06:59,145
(laughing)

185
00:06:59,145 --> 00:07:00,113
- [Crow] Mayor.

186
00:07:00,113 --> 00:07:01,863
- [Tom] That's right.

187
00:07:03,804 --> 00:07:06,353
♫ Yee hoo ♫

188
00:07:06,353 --> 00:07:07,601
- [Crow] I'm not too proud of this,

189
00:07:07,601 --> 00:07:09,638
just print my name small.

190
00:07:09,638 --> 00:07:11,805
- [Tom] I don't blame 'em.

191
00:07:14,033 --> 00:07:15,200
Ooh, dramatic.

192
00:07:16,518 --> 00:07:18,012
- [Joel] Sex Cameraman?

193
00:07:18,012 --> 00:07:20,006
- [Tom] No no no, SFX, Joel.

194
00:07:20,006 --> 00:07:21,734
- [Crow] Hey, twin Evinrudes, yeah.

195
00:07:21,734 --> 00:07:24,497
But you know I got a bass
boat flier on the front there.

196
00:07:24,497 --> 00:07:26,289
- [Tom] You got one of them
big bass chairs up front?

197
00:07:26,289 --> 00:07:27,313
- [Crow] Oh you betcha.

198
00:07:27,313 --> 00:07:28,409
- [Joel] You gotta keep your tips up

199
00:07:28,409 --> 00:07:30,756
when you're getting pulled
behind one of them big....

200
00:07:30,756 --> 00:07:32,423
- [All] Mighty Jack!

201
00:07:34,850 --> 00:07:35,935
(yells)

202
00:07:35,935 --> 00:07:37,908
- [Joel] Come on, dummy!

203
00:07:37,908 --> 00:07:39,796
- [Tom] We don't need to see this!

204
00:07:39,796 --> 00:07:41,204
No no no.

205
00:07:41,204 --> 00:07:42,825
- [Voiceover] Declaring that
if they continued to fight

206
00:07:42,825 --> 00:07:45,343
among themselves, they
face an even greater danger

207
00:07:45,343 --> 00:07:47,028
from an unexpected source.
- [Crow] Dr. Seuss.

208
00:07:47,028 --> 00:07:48,274
- [Tom] Peggy Lee.
- [Voiceover] The organization

209
00:07:48,274 --> 00:07:50,368
known as Q, equipped--
(yelling)

210
00:07:50,368 --> 00:07:52,422
- [Crow] Oh, we're falling
off, don't do that!

211
00:07:52,422 --> 00:07:53,723
- [Voiceover] More than
ever to pursue its goal

212
00:07:53,723 --> 00:07:56,604
of complete conquest of the Earth.

213
00:07:56,604 --> 00:07:58,854
(groaning)

214
00:08:01,436 --> 00:08:02,805
- [Crow] That funkin' book is heavy!

215
00:08:02,805 --> 00:08:05,826
- [Voiceover] Among friendly,
peace-loving countries.

216
00:08:05,826 --> 00:08:06,909
- [Tom] CP...

217
00:08:07,943 --> 00:08:09,193
- [Crow] Kitty!

218
00:08:10,338 --> 00:08:12,578
- [Tom] Japanese Calvin and Hobbes.

219
00:08:12,578 --> 00:08:14,413
- [Voiceover] Therefore,
the president proposes

220
00:08:14,413 --> 00:08:16,983
to form a team of
specially-trained men and women

221
00:08:16,983 --> 00:08:20,108
to combat the organization known as Q.

222
00:08:20,108 --> 00:08:21,462
- [Tom] He's looking for the narrator.

223
00:08:21,462 --> 00:08:22,462
- [Joel] Oh.

224
00:08:23,297 --> 00:08:25,782
- [Voiceover] This team will
be code named Mighty Jack.

225
00:08:25,782 --> 00:08:28,364
Using the latest technology,
Mighty Jack will have

226
00:08:28,364 --> 00:08:29,983
as its mission the annihilation of

227
00:08:29,983 --> 00:08:32,320
the organization known as Q.

228
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:34,487
(snoring)

229
00:08:38,625 --> 00:08:39,458
- Start!

230
00:08:39,458 --> 00:08:40,502
- [Crow] Cue that up!

231
00:08:40,502 --> 00:08:42,102
(laughing)

232
00:08:42,102 --> 00:08:45,409
