1743
01:08:46,838 --> 01:08:48,139
- [Tom] You understand him?

1744
01:08:48,139 --> 01:08:49,389
- [Joel] Mm-mm.

1745
01:08:50,390 --> 01:08:53,723
- Um, take me to the nearest plot point.

1746
01:08:55,195 --> 01:08:56,870
- [Tom] Nice helmet there.

1747
