1753
01:09:12,459 --> 01:09:13,292
- Please.

1754
01:09:14,798 --> 01:09:16,664
- [Crow] Tight pack, Captain.

1755
01:09:16,664 --> 01:09:19,247
(Tom chuckles)

1756
01:09:22,659 --> 01:09:23,662
- Pronto, pronto.

1757
01:09:23,662 --> 01:09:25,593
- [Joel] Pups, mini donuts, cotton candy,

1758
01:09:25,593 --> 01:09:26,426
that sort of thing.

1759
01:09:26,426 --> 01:09:29,343
