1761
01:09:31,726 --> 01:09:33,539
- [Tom] Ooh, ee, ooh ah ah, ting tang,

1762
01:09:33,539 --> 01:09:35,737
walla walla bing bang.

1763
01:09:35,737 --> 01:09:37,827
- [Joel] What, Gaddafi's
hosting silent theater?

1764
01:09:37,827 --> 01:09:39,535
- Operation two completed!

1765
01:09:39,535 --> 01:09:41,367
(chuckling)

1766
01:09:41,367 --> 01:09:43,517
- [Tom] Get on with this.

1767
01:09:43,517 --> 01:09:44,767
- Bene, pronto.

1768
01:09:45,757 --> 01:09:47,400
- [Crow] Buddha, I'm off script now.

1769
01:09:47,400 --> 01:09:49,983
(Tom chuckles)

1770
01:09:50,930 --> 01:09:52,003
- What did you say?

1771
01:09:52,003 --> 01:09:53,890
- [Joel] I don't know, it was Italian!

1772
01:09:53,890 --> 01:09:55,820
I think I ordered wine.

1773
01:09:55,820 --> 01:09:58,392
- They're now constructing a new island

1774
01:09:58,392 --> 01:09:59,821
