1775
01:09:59,821 --> 01:10:01,603
To replace the old one.

1776
01:10:01,603 --> 01:10:04,280
I just gave orders to have it destroyed.

1777
01:10:04,280 --> 01:10:06,307
With our iceberg method.

1778
01:10:06,307 --> 01:10:08,589
- [Tom] Iceberg lettuce?

1779
01:10:08,589 --> 01:10:10,081
- [Roberto] Of course.

1780
01:10:10,081 --> 01:10:12,589
Once it is destroyed, you
will no longer be able

1781
01:10:12,589 --> 01:10:16,052
to develop the weapons to defeat us.

1782
01:10:16,052 --> 01:10:17,885
- [Crow] You die Joan.

1783
01:10:19,069 --> 01:10:20,627
- [Roberto] The whole
of the United Nations

1784
01:10:20,627 --> 01:10:22,931
will have to submit to our will.

1785
01:10:22,931 --> 01:10:24,403
- You filthy traitor!

1786
01:10:24,403 --> 01:10:25,862
- [Joel] Thank you, say that again.

1787
01:10:25,862 --> 01:10:28,232
- You're not going to
get away with it though.

1788
01:10:28,232 --> 01:10:29,864
Mighty Jack will stop you!

1789
01:10:29,864 --> 01:10:31,101
- [Tom] Yeah, whatever.

1790
01:10:31,101 --> 01:10:33,171
- So you admit there's
a connection between

1791
01:10:33,171 --> 01:10:34,643
Mighty Jack and you?

1792
01:10:34,643 --> 01:10:37,162
- [Crow] She sang like a bird!

1793
01:10:37,162 --> 01:10:38,648
- [Roberto] No matter what they try,

1794
01:10:38,648 --> 01:10:41,443
Mighty Jack is now powerless.

1795
01:10:41,443 --> 01:10:43,860
- No, nothing will help them.

1796
01:10:44,998 --> 01:10:47,505
- Why do you say that?
- [Joel] 'Cause it's my line!

1797
01:10:47,505 --> 01:10:50,713
